{"title":"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> be positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e4035fc5c2e6064f4bec2469ee6799f56ad20b6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a}+ \\frac{1}{b} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" />. Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/4/f44d8f45014805648d0c67014e84bb1e5af721c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b)^{2018}-a^{2018}-b^{2018}&gt;= 2^{2\\cdot 2018}-2^{2019}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"339\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-ed